flowchart LR
    ADMIN[Quản trị viên<br/>quản lý tổ chức]
    CLINICAL[Clinical Service<br/>doctor_id, department_id]
    REPORT[Report Service<br/>cập nhật theo khoa]

    subgraph ORGANIZATION[Organization Service · mediflow_organization]
        DEPARTMENT[(DEPARTMENT<br/>PK department_id<br/>UK abbreviation<br/>FK department_head_id)]
        STAFF[(STAFF<br/>PK staff_id<br/>FK department_id<br/>license_number)]
        ACCOUNT[(ACCOUNT<br/>PK account_id<br/>UK username<br/>FK staff_id<br/>role)]

        DEPARTMENT -->|1:N nhân sự| STAFF
        STAFF -->|1:0..1 tài khoản| ACCOUNT
        STAFF -->|0..1 trưởng khoa| DEPARTMENT
    end

    DEPARTMENT_CREATED([department.created])
    STAFF_CREATED([staff.created])
    STAFF_CHANGED([staff.department.changed])

    ADMIN -->|CRUD| DEPARTMENT
    ADMIN -->|CRUD| STAFF
    ADMIN -->|cấp tài khoản| ACCOUNT
    CLINICAL -.->|REST validation · UUID logic| STAFF
    CLINICAL -.->|department_id · UUID logic| DEPARTMENT
    DEPARTMENT -.->|publish| DEPARTMENT_CREATED
    STAFF -.->|publish| STAFF_CREATED
    STAFF -.->|publish| STAFF_CHANGED
    STAFF_CHANGED -.->|consume| REPORT

    classDef external fill:#EFF6FF,stroke:#2563EB,color:#0F172A
